            "review_text": "Koh YJ\nSingapore, Singapore66 contributions\n2\nAt your own risk\nOct 2018 • Family\nThis is the most terrible Vietnam restaurant I ever been. Super poor service and language barrier. No one care to serve their customer although the dishes are ready waiting for delivery. We ordered 4 dishes, end up with only 3 served. Each dishes time gap is about 10 mins. It means we wait for 30 mins before we have our 3rd order. \nNot to mention the 4th order never come at all. \nThere are many nice and good service restaurant in Danang. Forget this one !!\nRead more\nWritten October 21, 2018",
